---
// WorkflowSection.astro
---

<section id="workflow" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-grid-pattern">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-teal-500/20">
        <i class="ri-refresh-line"></i>
        <span>全生命周期闭环</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        代码演进与知识自愈的完整闭环
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        从发现待编写模块、撰写证据化文档，到代码日常重构、行号漂移自愈与 CI 门禁，Loredex 提供零断裂的工业级知识流转。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step Flow Timeline -->
    <div class="relative">
      <!-- Central connecting line for desktop -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 top-8 bottom-8 -translate-x-1/2 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-500/40 via-teal-500/30 to-slate-800 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Step 1: Discover & Draft -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:text-right space-y-3">
            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              STEP 01
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">模块发现与候选证据捕获</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              通过目标扫描自动识别仓库分层与覆盖盲区。利用 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-emerald-300 font-mono text-xs">loredex evidence</code> 按关键词智能圈定可直接引用的代码区间，候选预览实时脱敏，安全无死角。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 mb-2">
              <span>loredex evidence crates/loredex-core --kw parse</span>
              <i class="ri-search-eye-line text-emerald-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-emerald-400">// 提取到的证据候选窗口</div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 mt-1">
              [[cite:crates/loredex-core/src/parser.rs:L88-L104]]<br />
              <span class="text-slate-500 pl-2">&rarr; pub fn parse_page_frontmatter(...) -&gt; Result&lt;...&gt;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Write & Pinned -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:order-2 space-y-3">
            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              STEP 02
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Agent 落地撰写与证据强约束</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Agent 或开发者撰写 Markdown 正文。每个关键事实绑定 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-teal-300 font-mono text-xs">[[cite:...]]</code>。严格拦截无引用内容或敏感 Token。无法考证的直觉随手用 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 font-mono text-xs">note</code> 落为明确的 draft，排入账本。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:order-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 mb-2">
              <span>Security & Integrity Gate</span>
              <span class="text-teal-400">STRICT-GATE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400">
              <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Evidence Pinned: 3 valid quadruples<br />
              <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Secret Filter: No API keys / tokens found<br />
              <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Frontmatter Schema: Validated
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Drift & Self-Healing -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:text-right space-y-3">
            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              STEP 03
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">日常代码演化与算法自愈</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              业务代码更新后，运行 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs">loredex auto</code>。若内容未变仅行号漂移，算法自动将旧行映射至新行；若发生 <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">git mv</code> 重命名，通过 blob oid 在 HEAD 毫秒级寻址恢复，保持 verified！
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 mb-2">
              <span>Projection Self-Healing Report</span>
              <span class="text-cyan-400">ALGORITHM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <div class="text-cyan-300">&bull; L12-L24 &rarr; Projected to L18-L30</div>
              <div class="text-slate-400 pl-3">Old snippet SHA: 4f1a... | New similarity: 0.96 (Pass)</div>
              <div class="text-emerald-400">&bull; Status updated: VERIFIED with note</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4: CI & PR Integration -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:order-2 space-y-3">
            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              STEP 04
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">CI/CD 自动化门禁与 PR 守护</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              在 GitHub Actions 中挂载 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-indigo-300 font-mono text-xs">loredex diff --since main</code> 与 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-indigo-300 font-mono text-xs">loredex lint</code>。PR 触及的核心引用若失效立时报警阻断合并；同时自动生成 AGENTS.md 引导块，让团队无感协作。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:order-1 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 mb-2">
              <span>GitHub Actions / Pre-merge Hook</span>
              <i class="ri-github-fill text-indigo-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400">
              $ loredex diff --since origin/main --fail-on-affected<br />
              <span class="text-emerald-400">✓ All affected citations valid</span><br />
              $ loredex lint<br />
              <span class="text-emerald-400">✓ 0 broken links, 0 stale citations, 0 secret exposures</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
